     "en": "A short story"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "Ravi saw tiny wriggling larvae in stagnant water.\n\"Those become mosquitoes,\" said his teacher."
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
    "type": "explanation",
    "provenance": "original",
